course: dictionary
lesson: 15908
title: Unmindful: not paying attention
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: «Unmindful» means not thinking about something, or not paying attention to it. It is a formal word, the kind you often meet in old stories and books.
explain: Look at the words around it for clues. «Unmindful of the danger, he ran on.» He ran on even though there was danger, so he was not thinking about the danger. Ask yourself: what would fit here? He did not think about the danger.
explain: Notice the little word «of». Unmindful is usually followed by «of», as in «unmindful of his friends' warnings». To check your meaning, put it into the sentence: he did not think about his friends' warnings. If that still makes sense, you have it.
fact: Unmindful means not thinking about something, or not paying attention to it.
fact: «Unmindful» is a formal or literary word, so you will mostly find it in stories and books.
fact: Unmindful is usually followed by «of», as in «unmindful of the time».
fact: The start «un-» often means «not», and «mindful» means paying attention, so unmindful means not paying attention.
fact: «Toad is often unmindful of his friends' warnings.»
exercise: «She was unmindful of the time, and she missed the bus.» What does unmindful mean here? | *Not thinking about the time | Angry about the time | Very quick about the time | Looking at a clock
exercise: Toad is ___ of his friends' warnings and keeps driving fast. Which word fits best? | happy | *unmindful | famished | ancient
exercise: What word usually comes after unmindful? | in | *of | the | and
test: «Unmindful of the rain, the children played on.» What does unmindful mean? | *Not noticing the rain | Asking about the rain | Wearing a coat against the rain | Hoping for more rain
test: Which word means not paying attention to something? | *unmindful | curt | glum | barely
exam: «He was unmindful of his friends' warnings and kept climbing.» What does unmindful mean in this sentence? | Angry at his friends | Eager to hear the warnings | Afraid of the mountain | *Not paying attention to the warnings
